+// whose every read and commit spans a madsim await boundary, against a concurrent task landing
+// at a point the seed (or a coverage walk) chooses. The concurrent writer emulates the protocol
+// batch 0016 §3 specifies for its actor — the part intent and part commit (#657), the publication
+// flip and the retirement drain (#658, #659), a session fence — because those writers have not
+// landed; what each property pins is this slice's half: what the reference build concludes while
+// the batch moves the records it reads.
